<section class="band fade" id="process" aria-labelledby="proc-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">II &nbsp;—&nbsp; How we work</span>
      <h2 id="proc-h">Three steps. No fluorescent lights.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Independent does not mean improvised. The cadence is the same for every client; what fills it is yours alone.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="process-grid">
      <article class="step">
        <span class="n">Step 01</span>
        <h3><span class="acc">Conversation</span></h3>
        <p>We meet — at the office, on a video call, or by phone. No deck. No pressure to commit. We talk about what you're working toward and what's actually in the way.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <span class="n">Step 02</span>
        <h3><span class="acc">Plan</span></h3>
        <p>If we're a fit, you receive a written plan — investments, retirement, tax coordination, insurance, estate. Not a brochure. A document that addresses your situation specifically.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <span class="n">Step 03</span>
        <h3><span class="acc">Partnership</span></h3>
        <p>Quarterly check-ins, annual reviews, and a phone that gets picked up the same day. The plan adjusts as your life does — not the other way around.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap"><div class="rule-band" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
